### ShortLink API — example requests (VS Code REST Client)
### Start the backend with `npm run dev` first.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Root info
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health (DB check)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### Create a link (generated code)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/a-very-long-url" }

### Create a link with alias, expiry and collection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/slides", "alias": "aws-slides", "expiresAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z", "collection": "AWS Workshop" }

### List links (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links

### Link details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/aws-slides

### Update a link (disable it)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/links/aws-slides
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isEnabled": false }

### Update a link (new URL + clear expiry)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/links/aws-slides
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/updated", "expiresAt": null }

### Link analytics (last 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/aws-slides/analytics?days=30

### Delete a link
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/links/aws-slides

### Redirect (follow manually; records a click)
GET {{baseUrl}}/abc123

### Collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/collections

### Audit trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit?limit=10

### API docs (Swagger UI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/docs/
